```javascript
const aad = CryptoJS.lib.WordArray.create(new Uint8Array([...authentication_additional_data]));
gcm.updateAAD(aad);
```

3. Encrypt and Authenticate the Message:
Now, you can encrypt and authenticate your message using the `encrypt` method. The `updateAAD` method has already processed the AAD, so there's no need to call it again when encrypting.

